Hi Karl,

Thanks for your reply!

So if I were to make full use of the data, would it be ok to read all of the data in as a 4-way cross?

Or would I have to analyze it by family by family, treating each as a 4-way cross, since I have multiple F2 families from different F1 pairs?

Best,

Elisa

